OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FLow cloud and hill fog will
OL,6,Flift to give some bright intervals.
OL,7,FHowever, cloud thickening from the
OL,8,Fnorthwest heading into the afternoon
OL,9,Fwith some showers developing. Feeling
OL,10,Fwarm and humid.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FThursday will be fresher with sunshine
OL,14,Fand a few showers. An isolated shower
OL,15,Fon Friday, though mostly dry with
OL,16,Ffurther sunshine developing at times
OL,17,Fheading into the weekend.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
